== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Added {{i|Censer}} to the [[Angel Room (Item Pool)|Angel room item pool]].

=== Changes ===
* Changed {{i|Stop Watch}} to only activate upon taking damage.
* The [[Greed machine]] jams less frequently.
* {{t|Missing Poster}} now revives Isaac as [[The Lost]]. Doing this in a sacrifice room now permanently unlocks The Lost.
* {{i|Mega Blast}} only gains 3 charges when picking up a [[little battery]].

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed {{i|Kamikaze!}} not damaging Isaac.
* Fixed [[Keeper]]'s visuals being overridden.

